`drop_subject_outliers` scores a feature that has the name of `subject_col` like any other. The subject labels used to overwrite such a feature, which was then left out of scoring, so a subject whose outlier lay only in that feature was kept. `compute_subject_outlier_burden` raises a `ValueError` when `subject_col` is in `feature_cols`; it scored the subject labels themselves, which count as missing values.
